        "bodyMarkdown": "# Oren Thane\n\n## Summary\n\nA licensed courier and former river scout whose ordinary routes let him cross watch lines without attracting attention. He is loyal to Ilyra but not naturally forthcoming.\n\n## Appearance\n\nLean, weathered, with river mud permanently worked into the seams of his boots. His courier coat has a repaired right cuff.\n\n## Voice\n\nSparse and literal. He answers the question asked, not the question implied.\n\n## Goals\n\nKeep Sable and the river routes outside centralized custody, help the reformed Archive move sealed responsibilities between independent custodians, and avoid learning identity-bearing details he does not need to carry.\n\n## Author notes\n\nOren knows Sable gave him the letter and that Ilyra ordered him to deliver heron-marked messages to Mara after her disappearance. He does not know the letter's contents.\n"
      }
